# commission: run by the runtime as it starts (a deploy; again at a
# restart, its lines idempotent: a deploy of what is there a warning); the
# deploy waits for it. Its components first, each commissioned by its own
# (the cascade), linked in it; then the help viewer in its Splectral, its
# help view (it finds the docs mrepo by its unique URI, local/docs); then
# its own service, initialised, started.
boot/deploy docs haiccing/base-component-docs
boot/deploy splectral haiccing/base-package-splectral
haicc splectral boot/deploy help haiccing/base-package-service
haicc splectral splectral/install help splectral/base-component-help-viewer
haicc splectral/help service/initialise
haicc splectral/help service/start
service/initialise
service/start
